              对 `Gap E` 给出明确处理路线：当前 track 继续执行，或拆为后续独立 track
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YG>
              <Criterion { id = "T6.4-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YH>
              如果未建立第二领域或更强重复实现证据，当前 track 不得再次被误标为 fully complete
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YH>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P7 { name = "Gap E Evidence Continuation" status = "DONE" order = 6 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YJ>
        继续执行 `Gap E` 的正向证据路线，在不夸大当前平台结论的前提下，验证平台 baseline 的跨领域可复用边界。
        </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YJ>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T7.1" name = "执行 Gap E 的下一轮证据路线" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YK>
            继续在“第二领域 spike”或“更强重复实现分析”两条路线中选择其一，产出更接近正向结论的证据；如果证据仍不足，则明确记录未证明部分并保持 track `in_progress`。
            </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YK>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T7.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YM>
              对平台 baseline 哪些部分已被证明跨领域可复用、哪些仍未被证明给出更强证据
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YM>
              <Criterion { id = "T7.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YN>
              若证据仍不足，当前 track 继续保持 `in_progress`，且 `platform-logic` 继续禁止引入
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YN>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P8 { name = "Gap E Positive-Evidence Execution" status = "DONE" order = 7 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YP>
        在结构化证据矩阵基础上，继续寻找真正的正向跨领域证据，决定平台边界是否还能得到更强验证。
        </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YP>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T8.1" name = "执行第二领域 spike 或更强重复实现样例" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YQ>
            基于 `analysis/gap-e-evidence-matrix.md` 的未证明项，选择“最小第二领域 spike”或“更强重复实现样例”其中一条路线，产出真正新增的正向证据；若仍失败，则明确记录失败点并考虑拆分为独立 evidence track。
            </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YQ>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T8.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YR>
              至少新增一类此前不存在的正向证据，而不是重复当前否定性判断
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YR>
              <Criterion { id = "T8.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YS>
              若仍未形成正向证据，明确记录失败点，并给出是否拆分独立 evidence track 的决策
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YS>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #P9 { name = "Completion Semantics Reconciliation" status = "DONE" order = 8 } (
        <Description ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YT>
        统一 track 完成态、上下文入口与 evidence gate 门槛表述，确保新 session 不会被当前 `completed` 语义误导。
        </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YT>
        <SubNodes [
          <Task { id = "T9.1" name = "统一 completed 语义与上下文描述" status = "DONE" order = 0 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YV>
            对齐 `context.md`、`metadata.json`、analysis 与 track 范围结论，明确“当前 track 完成”是指当前范围内目标完成，而不是两层微内核全部成熟度 gap 已关闭。
            </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YV>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T9.1-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YW>
              `context.md` 不再同时出现“track 已完成”和“当前仍存在剩余 gap”的冲突表述
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YW>
              <Criterion { id = "T9.1-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YX>
              新 session 仅阅读当前 track 即能理解：哪些目标已完成，哪些问题只是后续候选工作
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YX>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T9.2" name = "修正 platform-logic evidence gate 的门槛表述" status = "DONE" order = 1 priority = "P0" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YY>
            把 evidence gate 从“出现第二领域或重复实现证据”修正为“出现足够强的第二领域或重复实现证据，且仍需证明需要独立 `platform-logic`”，避免最小第二领域 spike 被误读成放开信号。
            </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YY>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T9.2-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YZ>
              `context.md`、相关 analysis 与 guardrail 文案不再暗示“只要有第二领域证据就能引入 platform-logic”
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6YZ>
              <Criterion { id = "T9.2-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6Z0>
              新 session 能明确理解：当前最小第二领域 spike 只证明平台 baseline，不证明 `platform-logic` 合法
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6Z0>
            ]>
          )>
          <Task { id = "T9.3" name = "决定当前 track 的最终收尾动作" status = "DONE" order = 2 priority = "P1" } (
            <Description ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6Z1>
            在完成 `T9.1` 与 `T9.2` 后，决定当前 track 是否可归档；若仍保留未收口的语义问题，则继续保持 `in_progress` 并明确后续入口。
            </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6Z1>
            <Acceptance [
              <Criterion { id = "T9.3-AC1" checked = true } ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6Z2>
              归档或继续进行的决策有明确理由，不再依赖口头说明
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6Z2>
              <Criterion { id = "T9.3-AC2" checked = true } ?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6Z3>
              若选择归档，track 内文档已不存在误导新 session 的完成态矛盾
              </?01M05F1PCTHN57V8KJ124GC6Z3>
            ]>
          )>
        ]>
        <Hooks [
          <Hook { on = "phase:after" } (
            <GapLoop { max_rounds = 5 on_exhausted = "block" }>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
    ]>
  )>
  <Schedule>
)>
